# =============================================================================
# DATA KAMUS BAHASA BUGIS — BATCH 4: 100 ENTRI (nomor 201–300)
# Domain: Pertanian & Makanan Tradisional | Perdagangan & Maritim |
#         Religi & Ritual | Peralatan & Teknologi Tradisional |
#         Bahasa & Sastra Bugis
# Semantic Web Course — Proyek Akhir
# Encoding: UTF-8
# Sumber: OJED (sealang.net/ojed), Wiktionary Bugis,
#         Matthes (1874) Bugis–Dutch Dictionary
# Aksara Lontaraq: Unicode Block Buginese U+1A00–U+1A1F
#   Verifikasi: r12a.github.io/scripts/bugi/bug.html (27-Apr-2026)
#   Konsonan: ᨀka ᨁga ᨂng ᨄpa ᨅba ᨆma ᨈta ᨉda ᨊna ᨌca ᨍja ᨎnya
#             ᨐya ᨑra ᨒla ᨓwa ᨔsa ᨕA(vokal) ᨖha
#   Vokal diakritik: ᨗi ᨘu ᨙe(prebase) ᨚo ᨛə
#   Catatan: konsonan akhir suku kata TIDAK ditulis dalam Lontaraq (coda omission)
# =============================================================================

@prefix bugis:  <http://example.org/bugis#> .
@prefix rdf:    <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs:   <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl:    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix xsd:    <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .


# =============================================================================
# AKAR KATA TAMBAHAN (Batch 4)
